# QA M5 regression (D-087 deck-bollard rule): the last-moment hop over the
# pontoon bollard. As qa_m5_pontoon_bollard_squeeze to the respawn on the
# lantern pontoon (Gelse #1 death at 2148, respawn 2208) and she stands
# still while the edge pushes her towards the bollard at col 133 (squeezed
# at 2670 if she stays). A standing full jump pressed at 2666, 4 frames
# before the squeeze, clears the bollard (the push carries her over it)
# and she lands in the water behind the pontoon: no second death. One
# standing jump pressed anywhere in 2634-2666 (33 frames) saves her; an
# earlier one lands back on the deck in front of the bollard.
